      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMUM SUNSET (2) hit the ground running and set it up early clocking 22.07 with a 3.5 lengths win at Warrnambool over 390m. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Can continue on her winning ways. RUMOUR I'M BROKE (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 20.39 in a neck win at this track over 350m. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Should be in this for a long way. DR. LOUIS (6) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from six tries. Below best last time at Warragul (23.46) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length fifth. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. PAW NASCENT (3) cannot be underestimated.",
